<title>USA: Tandem Computers Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Tandem Computers Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>CUPERTINO, Calif., Oct 24 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.14	  profit  $0.17</p>
<p> Net profit	16,936	 profit  19,791</p>
<p> Revs		543,245		  546,709</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  118,884		  117,743</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.19	  profit  $0.91</p>
<p> Net loss	  22,757	 profit  107,546</p>
<p> Revs		1,899,943		1,920,436</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  117,536		  118,217</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Q4 1996 EPS from continuing operations $0.34 vs $0.20. 1996 12 months EPS income from continuing operations loss $0.04 vs profit $0.82.</p>
</text>
